                                            Restricted Shareholder and/or its Concert Parties (if any) extending an offer to the holders
                                            of each class of shares of the Company in accordance with Rule 9 of the Takeover Rules; or</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 1.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

